						<td class="title">
							Annwyl's Bio
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							All those stats above are unbuffed, just with my regular equipment. (Listed below)<br>
<br>
Annwyl was the very first D&amp;D character I created.  I wanted to be a mage, but my DM screwed up when guiding me to create and didn't believe in erasers so I ended up being a gnome rogue.  I was in EQ beta 4 at that point so I started Annwyl in EQ to see what a gnome rogue was like... and was forever in love with the character.<br>
<br>
When EQ was in release, I basically powerlevelled and was the highest level rogue on The Rathe until about level 40, where I slowed down my play time and a few others got ahead of me, then I stopped playing for a few months and a LOT of people got ahead of me!  I ended up at level 48 for about 6 months until Kunark came out.<br>
<br>
My one other claim to fame is that Kinien Northoak and I had the first public wedding in EQ release, and there were a few hundred Rathians gathered in Butcherblock mountains that glorious day!<br>
<br>
I joined KEG (Knighs of Eternal Good) in July of 1999, about 2 weeks after it was formed.   So, I'm not quite a &quot;founding member&quot; but almost!  KEG is my EQ life and there's no way I'd still be playing EQ without them.<br>
<br>
Due to my lack of time to play because of real life committments (Work, a little bit of college, and *gasp* real life friends, and a boyfriend!) Annwyl is still only level 54, but she has her heart and soul set on staying in KEG until the next big thing comes out. :)  (Was this long enough?)							&nbsp;
						</td>
					</tr>
